\title{VerifiedLibc journal}

\p{Working notes for VerifiedLibc, kept in the repository under \code{journal/}. Agents and maintainers record dated changes, lessons, decisions, open problems and sessions here as small trees that link to each other, so that a later session can see what was changed, why, and what was tried without success.}

